een through so  much the last couple of years are you  hoping that this somewhat changes the  story of what people think of  Minneapolis  I think it it will we are in the Lake  Street store this is hope this is Joy  this is what's possible and this is how  we're going to bring this community and  Minneapolis forward if this is the  Hustler of the future yes for CBS  mornings Jamie yukas Minneapolis  all right Jamie thank you
 

